  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Humanitarian Response 2023-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supported humanitarian emergency relief responses to vulnerable communities in Solomon Islands affected by tropical cyclones Lola and Mal in 2023-24. Supplies were provided to the local disaster management office for distribution. This investment also covered repatriation of 79 Solomon Islanders from Israel during the Hamas-Israel conflict in 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
