    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2023, DFAT assisted the return of 79 Solomon Islanders from Israel to Honiara following the worsening situation in Israel and the Palestinian Occupied Territories.
&#x200d;
79 people (36 women and 43 men).
&#x200d;
Australia funded the delivery of humanitarian relief supplies to the remote outer islands of Temotu impacted by Tropical Cyclone Lola in October 2023, ensuring the 2,500 people living in these islands had access to food, shelter, medical and school supplies</narrative>
    </description>
